    "source": "rezono 0\npack rule-demo\nuse std-order as ordering\nrule `replaces`(`at`: ordering.Alpha, n: Int) explain fold when\n  ordering.Alpha.related(_, `at`)\n  and not ordering.`count`(`at`)\n  or (Alpha.related(_, `at`) where it.active is known).count() >= 1 + 2 * 3\nrule `replaces`(x, x.`at`) with local: ordering.Alpha when x in ordering.Alpha\nrule eligible(x) when x.score >= 1 + 2 * 3\n  or not x.active and x.score in 1..<10\n",
    "ask": "ask Alpha where x.score >= 1 + 2 * 3 or not x.active and x.score in 1..<10",
    "module": {
      "rezono": "0",
      "pack": "rule-demo",
      "use": [{"use": "std-order", "as": "ordering"}],
      "decls": [
